@startuml
title F1 Digital Twin — Phase G.3.4 Incremental Streaming ETL Architecture

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

package "Ingestion & Streaming Storage" {
  [Kafka Topic: f1_telemetry] as Kafka
  [PySpark Structured Streaming] as StreamingEngine
  [MinIO S3A / Bronze Lake] as Bronze
}

package "Silver Incremental Transformer" {
  [State Manifest Engine] as StateManifest
  [Schema V1 Validation] as SchemaVal
  [Deduplication Engine] as Deduper
  [Derived Metrics Calculator] as MetricsEngine
  [MinIO S3A / Silver Lake] as Silver
  [MinIO S3A / Quarantine Lake] as Quarantine
}

package "Gold Incremental Builder" {
  [Incremental Aggregator] as Aggregator
  [MinIO S3A / Gold Lake] as Gold
}

Kafka --> StreamingEngine : Raw JSON Stream
StreamingEngine --> Bronze : Micro-batch Parquet Writes\n(Partitioned: year/month/day/hour)

Bronze --> StateManifest : Delta Detection\n(New file paths)
StateManifest --> SchemaVal : Validate New Records
SchemaVal --> Deduper : Filter Duplicate event_ids\n(State manifest seen_event_ids)

Deduper --> Quarantine : Invalid & Duplicate Events\n(s3a://f1-data-lake/quarantine/telemetry/)
Deduper --> MetricsEngine : Valid New Records

MetricsEngine --> Silver : Enriched Parquet Writes\n(speed_ms, aero_efficiency, tire_stress_index, acceleration_estimate)
Silver --> StateManifest : Update state.json Manifest\n(processed_files & seen_event_ids)

Silver --> Aggregator : Read Incremental Silver Parquet
Aggregator --> Gold : Re-aggregate 5 Gold Datasets\n(lap_performance, tire_performance, fuel_performance, aero_performance, anomaly_summary)

@enduml
